_⚠️ Potential issue_

**Fix: avoid creating placements for selected pages that were skipped (orphan) to prevent NPE on import**

If a top-level selected page is orphaned, it is skipped above and no <page> element is exported. However, this loop still creates a <lessonbuilder> placement for it. In mergeInternal, the code dereferences the corresponding page element (see Lines 1814-1824: pageElement = pageElementMap.get(...); pageElement.getAttribute(...)), which will be null and cause an NPE.

Guard against this by filtering out orphans (and optionally track them in selectionSkipped), and use a deterministic ordering for pagePosition.


Apply this diff within this block:
```diff
-                Set<Long> topLevelSelectedPages = findTopLevelSelectedPages(selectedPageIds, siteId);
-
-                for (Long topLevelPageId : topLevelSelectedPages) {
