Since `OutlookReader` in this PR already migrated to `BOMInputStream.builder()`, do the same here for consistency.

Additionally, line 3457 passes the raw `risImportStream` to `InputStreamReader` instead of `irs`, meaning the BOM-stripped bytes are lost. Switch to `new InputStreamReader(irs, bomCharsetName)` so BOM detection actually takes effect.

