_🔒 Security & Privacy_ | _🔴 Critical_ | _⚡ Quick win_

**Data leakage risk: Bypassing site filters when `includeStealthed` is true.**

By combining `!isAdmin && !includeStealthed` into a single condition, any query where `includeStealthed` is `true` will entirely bypass the `WHERE` clause for non-admins. If a non-admin user can trigger a lookup with this flag enabled, they will retrieve all tools across the entire system—including tools owned by other sites—resulting in a cross-tenant data leak.

The site ownership and deployment constraints must always apply to non-admins. The `includeStealthed` flag should only control whether globally stealthed tools are appended to their authorized visibility scope.



