A draft save may already be running when `release()` calls `_savePendingChanges(2)`. In that case, Lines 329-331 set `_saveAgain = true` and return early. The early return happens before Line 340 applies `status`. The retry at Line 385 then reads `this._pendingChanges.status`, which is still `1`. `dispatchRatingChanged` or the first save set that value.

Trigger: the grader clicks Save and then Save and Release before the first request finishes. `SakaiGrader._save` calls `release()`, and `setGrade.json` returns the grade to the student. The rubric evaluation stays `DRAFT`.

Record the highest status requested while a save is in flight. Use that status for the retry.

